      ],
      "remarks": "Certified intended behavior of the article-buddy editorial pipeline (REPOS/article-buddy-2026). Publishing-integrity policy: every published article passes the QA gate and a fact-check; any non-PASS fact-check verdict (FAIL or WARN) must be remediated before publication; web egress is certified only for the fact-checker agent (local-first pipeline otherwise). Publication ('publish') is the critical sink. DL-6 is intentionally omitted: the pipeline has no autonomy-fraction semantics (its budget control is monetary and observed via budget events, not certified here). DL-4 omitted: certified error posture is the pipeline's own fail-and-checkpoint behavior."
    },
